
Problem: Creating legal documents is complicated and time-consuming.

Idea: An AI website that generates legal document drafts from simple user inputs.

Target Users: Individuals, freelancers, startups, landlords, and small businesses.

Key Features:

AI document generation

Ready-made templates

Simple questionnaire

Edit and customize documents

Download as PDF/DOCX

Explain legal terms in simple language

Main Flow: Choose document → Answer questions → AI generates draft → Edit → Download.

Future Scope: Multilingual support, lawyer review, document comparison, and AI legal assistance.


